{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Final plan-review attempt BLOCKED; leaving open per operator instruction. Verbatim blocking finding:\\n\\nAn existing test outside the enumerated set — tests/unit/test_reconcile_bridge_canary_class.py::test_every_bug_close_carries_valid_class — asserts both the heartbeat and binding-drift close argv carry a --force flag (line 113: `assert any(a.startswith(\"--force\") for a in argv)`). Removing --force per the plan will make this test FAIL, but the plan's moved-test inventory, verification plan, and acceptance criteria never mention it."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788785203699962001,"uuid":"a47a90ee-6f99-44b9-ac67-bbb3e3615775"}